<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>المادة الأولى | منصة طلاب دفعة 023</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-dark: #0A192F;
            --primary-blue: #1E3A8A;
            --accent-gold: #D97706;
            --accent-gold-light: #FBBF24;
            --bg-light: #F8FAFC;
            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
            --text-main: #0F172A;
            --text-muted: #64748B;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; background: var(--bg-light); color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.7; }
        .container { width: min(1180px, 92%); margin: auto; }

        header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark) 0%, var(--primary-blue) 100%); color: white; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-gold); }
        .nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .back-btn { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
        .back-btn:hover { background: var(--accent-gold); }

        .subject-hero { background: var(--primary-dark); color: white; padding: 40px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1E293B; }
        .subject-hero h1 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; }
        .subject-hero p { color: var(--accent-gold-light); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 6px; }

        .content-section { margin: 35px 0; }
        .section-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 16px; border-right: 4px solid var(--accent-gold); padding-right: 12px; }

        .file-list { background: white; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .file-item { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9; }
        .file-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .file-info { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .file-icon { font-size: 22px; }
        .file-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-main); }
        .download-btn { background: var(--primary-dark); color: white; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
        .download-btn:hover { background: var(--accent-gold); }

        footer { background: var(--primary-dark); color: white; text-align: center; padding: 25px 0; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="container nav">
            <h2 style="font-size: 20px;">📘 قسم المواد الدراسية</h2>
            <a href="subjects.html" class="back-btn">⬅️ العودة لجميع المواد</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="subject-hero">
